safix::public_not_editable

  × 'wg-public' is a public output, so its value is already plaintext at
  │ public/safix/users/ana/wg-public/value; there is nothing to decrypt and
  │ nothing to encrypt.
  │ 
  │ A public output is minted by the generator that declares it. Re-run `safix
  │ generate` to replace it, or edit public/safix/users/ana/wg-public/value
  │ directly — it is an ordinary file in the repository, which is what
  │ declaring it `secret = false` means.
